  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:300px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-plum pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Tantric Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/af/Sigmund_Freud_%28Super_Science_Friends%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20201231063034\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Sigmund Freud (Super Science Friends)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/af/Sigmund_Freud_%28Super_Science_Friends%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20201231063034\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/af/Sigmund_Freud_%28Super_Science_Friends%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20201231063034 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/a/af/Sigmund_Freud_%28Super_Science_Friends%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20201231063034 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Sigmund Freud (Super Science Friends)\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" data-image-key=\"Sigmund_Freud_%28Super_Science_Friends%29.png\" data-image-name=\"Sigmund Freud (Super Science Friends).png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Sigmund Freud (Super Science Friends) can absorb people's sexual aura.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb sexual energy.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb sexual energy</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Tantric_Manipulation\" title=\"Tantric Manipulation\">Tantric Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Sex_Empowerment\" title=\"Sex Empowerment\">Sex Empowerment</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb sexual energy, while removing it from the source, into their body and use it in various ways, gaining some form of advantage, either by enhancing themselves, gaining the drained power, using it as power source etc., either temporarily or permanently.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorbing_Regeneration\" title=\"Absorbing Regeneration\">Absorbing Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Assimilation_Shield\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Assimilation Shield\">Assimilation Shield</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Enhanced_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Enhanced Condition\">Enhanced Condition</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Pleasure_Immunity\" title=\"Pleasure Immunity\">Pleasure Immunity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sex_Empowerment\" title=\"Sex Empowerment\">Sex Empowerment</a> via absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sexuality_Manipulation\" title=\"Sexuality Manipulation\">Sexuality Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Succubus_Physiology\" title=\"Succubus Physiology\">Succubus Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tantric_Manipulation\" title=\"Tantric Manipulation\">Tantric Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Sigmund Freud (<i>Super Science Friends</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Videos\">Videos</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-galle